# This repository tracks VoxelBridge, VoxelCity design, and the archived DynamicGI prototype.
# The Polygon environment, scenes, imported packages, generated data, and Unity
# caches belong to the local laboratory and are deliberately excluded.
*

# Repository metadata and documentation.
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md

# World design sources and references; other local documentation stays excluded.
!/Docs/
/Docs/*
!/Docs/WorldDesign/
/Docs/WorldDesign/*
!/Docs/WorldDesign/VoxelCity/
!/Docs/WorldDesign/VoxelCity/**

# Portable Unity package content, including every required .meta file.
!/Assets/
/Assets/*
!/Assets/VoxelBridge.meta
!/Assets/VoxelBridge/
!/Assets/VoxelBridge/**

# Record the editor version used to validate the module without carrying the
# rest of the project-specific settings into another project.
!/ProjectSettings/
/ProjectSettings/*
!/ProjectSettings/ProjectVersion.txt

# Archived prototype, outside Unity imports.
!/Archives/
/Archives/*
!/Archives/DynamicGI.zip
